      {
        "met_days": 0,
        "type": "launch",
        "label": "Launch — Atlas V 541",
        "description": "Cape Canaveral, 2020-07-30. Mars 2020 carries Perseverance — a near-identical chassis to Curiosity but with a sample-caching coring system and the Ingenuity helicopter strapped under the belly. Designed to land in Jezero Crater, a 3.5-Gyr-old river delta sediment trap chosen specifically for organic-preservation potential."
      },
      {
        "met_days": 0.005,
