      {
        "met_days": 203,
        "type": "arrival",
        "label": "Mars approach + cruise-stage separation",
        "description": "2021-02-18. 10 minutes before atmospheric entry, the cruise stage jettisons; the backshell + descent stage + rover enters Mars's atmosphere at 5.4 km/s."
      },
      {
        "met_days": 203.005,
        "type": "edl_or_oi",
        "label": "Mars EDL — sky-crane landing in Jezero Crater",
        "description": "\"Seven minutes of terror\", same architecture as Curiosity but adding Terrain-Relative Navigation — the rover steered itself away from boulders during the parachute descent using a vision-based hazard map. Landed 2021-02-18 at 18.4447°N, 77.4508°E on the Jezero crater floor (Octavia E. Butler Landing); reached the delta front in April 2022. First successful sample tube cached 2021-09-06. Ingenuity helicopter's first flight 2021-04-19 — first powered flight on another planet."
      }
